    "minors": [
      "`merge_gate.py` accesses the private function `release_pr._require_committed` across module boundaries; a small public wrapper (e.g. `require_committed`) in `pull_request.py` would be cleaner and avoid coupling to an underscore-prefixed name.",
      "`handoff.py` defines a local `_mission_root` helper that lazy-imports `assembly_store` to avoid a circular import; this works but is slightly fragile. A top-level import of `assembly_store` (which has no reverse dependency on `handoff`) would be simpler and more discoverable.",
